18 0 obj
<< /A 47 0 R /Alt (Composite image of data visualizations analyzing serum effects:   \(A\) Volcano plot shows upregulated and downregulated genes in serum positive versus negative, with significance indicated by color.   \(B\) Heatmap depicts gene expression over days with serum status.   \(C, E, G\) Violin plots displaying IFN, cytokine/cytotoxicity, and exhaustion scores respectively, over different days and serum conditions.   \(D, F, H\) Corresponding box plots for the same scores, visualizing statistical distribution over time and serum presence.) /K 0 /P 8 0 R /Pg 36 0 R /S /Figure /T () >>
endobj
19 0 obj
<< /A 48 0 R /Alt <> /K 0 /P 8 0 R /Pg 37 0 R /S /Figure /T () >>
endobj
20 0 obj
<< /A 49 0 R /Alt (Multiple graphs display data on cell group sizes and diversity across different conditions and time points. Graphs A, B, and C present stacked bar charts showing cell group distribution by size category such as hyperexpanded, large, medium, small, and rare. Graph D is a circular diagram illustrating relationships among donors. Graphs E and F display area curves comparing diversity in treated and control serum samples over time. Graph G depicts line charts of Shannon Entropy, measuring diversity fluctuations for donors A, B, and C across different days and serum conditions. Each graph is annotated with detailed legends.) /K 0 /P 8 0 R /Pg 38 0 R /S /Figure /T () >>
endobj
